5	/**
6	 * Single source of truth for the optional {@code Idempotency-Key} request header that drives the
7	 * idempotent {@code POST /api/owners} create: both the {@link CheckOwnerIdempotency} entry step and
8	 * the {@link RecordOwnerIdempotency} step read and normalize the header through here, so the header
